# Never in this repo, and never in its history:
#   source clips/   a real person's voice recording
#   out/            generated speech in that voice
#   voices/         prefix-KV snapshots -- DERIVED from a voice recording.
#                   118 MiB of prefilled model state per voice: not audio,
#                   but it exists only to reproduce someone's voice, so it
#                   is the same personal data wearing a different format.
#   test script/    third-party documentation, not ours to redistribute
# Excluded from the first commit rather than removed later, because taking a
# file out of git history means rewriting it.
source clips/
out/
voices/
test script/

venv/
torch-ext-cache/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Runtime state: pidfile, server log, the encoded reference.
run/

# Per-machine paths, possibly including a path to a voice recording.
bin/env.local
